{
  "name": "人類Human （GGR）",
  "type": "race",
  "img": "icons/environment/people/commoner.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p><span class=\"bbc_size\" style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Noto Sans SC'\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">人類</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><em>人類在拉尼卡諸多種族中僅佔少數，他們支配着一些公會，在其他公會中則並不突出。與其他世界中一樣，人類是革新者、成功者和先驅者，他們的勇氣和 適應力使他們能成就偉大的事業——當然也有慘重的失敗。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" />儘管歐佐夫集團鬼影議會源自人類，但十公會的元祖中沒有一個是人類。同樣的，目前沒有一個公會會長是人類。不過人類在許多公會中擔任副官，顧問或策士。他們的野心和幹勁驅使着他們上進，但是遠古龍，斯芬克斯和惡魔等生物的純粹力量使人類遠離了權力的頂峯。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" />拉尼卡的人類與其他世界的人類在身體上並沒有多大區別。同樣的，他們的傾向也多種多樣：他們是唯一一個在所有公會中都存在的種族。</em></span></p></blockquote><h2></h2><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">人類的名字</strong><br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" />一種特殊的人類語言戰勝了所有其他語言，成爲拉尼卡的通用語，它的音素和傳統塑造了拉尼卡的大多數人類的名字。人類有時會借用其他種族的名字，但是他們有豐富的傳統名字可供借鑑。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" />姓氏的使用似乎是一種特殊的人類習俗。姓氏是從父母雙方傳給子女的，有時孩子使用父母雙方的姓氏。例如，米歇爾·薩沃德·祖尼奇（Micyl Savod Zunich）是範·祖尼奇（Fann Zunich）和婕德·瓦德·薩沃德（Jarad Vod Savod）的兒子。當其他種族使用姓氏時，他們通常來源於與人類家庭的某種聯繫（不一定是血緣關係）。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">男用名:</strong> Agmand, Agosto, Bell, Brev, Oars, Dobromir, Dravin, Evern, Gorev，lvos, Janik, Ju ri, Lannos, Lucian, Micas, Nikos, Obez, Olrik,Osidar, Rogad, Sergiu,Sirislav, Tibor, Trigori, Tzaric, Uzric, Valen, Vennick, Viet, Vorimir, Vuliev, Zunak<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">女用名:</strong> Anksa, Aszala, Berta, Bori, Brisks, Dahlya, Geetra, lzolda, Jozica, Lavinia, Luda, Iyzolda, Milana, Miatrl, Nefara, Palla, Pel, Rube,Strava, Sulli, Vina, Voka, Zija<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">姓氏:</strong> Andon, Bara, Bejiri, Borca, Capobar, Forenzad, Gerava, Gharti， Golozar, Gostok, Grezar, Helsk, Javya, Karlaus, Kirescu， Koba, Kos,Macav, Migellic, Nar, Nodov, Pelerine, Pijha, Ralinu， Ringer, Rokiric, Sarv, Shonn, Suszat, Tandris, Trul, Tylver, Valenco, Vay，Vinloskarya, Wenslauv,Yaszen</span></p><h2>人類特質Human Traits</h2><p>    人類很難一概而論，你的人類角色具有以下種族特質。</p><p><strong>屬性值加成Ability Score Increase</strong>。你的全部屬性值加1。<br /><strong>年齡Age</strong>。人類不到20歲成年，而很少活過100 歲。<br /><strong>陣營Alignment</strong>。人類並不偏向特定陣營。這個種羣中存在着最好的人以及最壞的人。<br /><strong>體型Size</strong>。人類身高差距很大，有的剛好5尺高，而有的甚至高過6尺。不論你有多高，你的體型皆爲中型。<br /><strong>速度Speed</strong>。你的基礎步行速度爲30尺。<br /><strong>語言Languages</strong>。你能夠說、讀、寫通用語和一門額外的自選語言。在與他人交流時，人類通常會主動去學習對方的語言，其中也包括了一些晦澀的方言。他們還喜歡在說話時夾雜其他語言的腔調，如獸人粗口，精靈樂調，矮人軍號，等等。</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
